{"id":"wanne","lemma":"Wanne","pos":"noun","rank":4541,"glosses":["for bathing or washing","for technical uses, especially to collect or hold liquids","for kitchen use"],"ipa":"/ˈvanə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/ab/De-Wanne.ogg/De-Wanne.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Wanne","plural":"Wannen"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich bin in der Wanne.","en":"I'm in the bathtub.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/391644","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Die Wanne ist voll.","en":"The tub is full.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"full"}]},{"text":"Es ist kein Wasser in der Wanne.","en":"There's no water in the tub.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"no / not a"},{"g":"water"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Tom stieg aus der Wanne und trocknete sich ab.","en":"Tom got out of the bathtub and dried himself off.","words":[null,{"g":"to ascend","l":"steigen"},{"g":"out of / from"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"and"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"beginning at that time…"}]},{"text":"Tom legte seine Sachen ab und stieg in die Wanne.","en":"Tom took off his clothes and got into the bathtub.","words":[null,{"g":"to lie down","l":"legen"},{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},{"g":"matter","l":"Sache"},{"g":"beginning at that time…"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"to ascend","l":"steigen"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}